{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "course-narrate",
  "title": "知识口播",
  "titleEn": "Knowledge talking-head",
  "summary": "课程讲稿→讲师定妆照+口播视频+口型同步（video.lipSync）+SVG知识图解动画+配音+BGM→成片时间线",
  "category": "comic",
  "tags": [
    "知识口播",
    "口型同步",
    "SVG图解动效",
    "课程视频",
    "成片时间线"
  ],
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "author": {
    "name": "AIArtEngine",
    "url": "https://github.com/Justin-sky/ai-art-engine"
  },
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
  "cover": "cover.png",
  "requires": {
    "nodeTypes": [
      "asset.image",
      "asset.music",
      "asset.video",
      "asset.voice",
      "note.text",
      "output.timeline",
      "text.plain",
      "svg.anim",
      "svg.gen",
      "video.lipSync"
    ],
    "appMinVersion": "7.1.0"
  },
  "plan": {
    "title": "知识课程口播",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "key": "script",
        "typeId": "text.plain",
        "title": "课程结构化讲稿",
        "params": {
          "text": "【黄金前3秒认知钩子】为什么 90% 的人学了很多方法依然做不好时间管理？\n【核心原理图解】真正决定效率的不是日程表，而是认知负荷的「双通道分配模型」。\n【实操行动指南】记住这三个微习惯，每天立刻省出两小时深度工作时间。"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "portrait",
        "typeId": "asset.image",
        "title": "主讲人定妆照（锚点）",
        "params": {
          "generateInstruction": "知识付费主讲人半身标准定妆照：正面平视镜头，知性亲和专业气质，现代极简书房暖光背景，面部光影均匀清晰，纯画面无文字",
          "generateAspectRatio": "9:16"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "talking",
        "typeId": "asset.video",
        "title": "主讲人出镜底片",
        "params": {
          "generateInstruction": "主讲人正对镜头自然讲述，手势克制得体，眼神专注亲和，半身竖屏构图，背景光影稳定",
          "generateDuration": 10,
          "generateAspectRatio": "9:16"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "voice",
        "typeId": "asset.voice",
        "title": "讲师口播配音",
        "params": {
          "generateInstruction": "沉稳、清晰、富有启发性的金牌讲师口播音色，逻辑重音分明，按讲稿自然朗读"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "lipSync",
        "typeId": "video.lipSync",
        "title": "数字人口型同步"
      },
      {
        "key": "svgGen",
        "typeId": "svg.gen",
        "title": "核心知识点动态板书（SVG）",
        "params": {
          "generateInstruction": "根据课程核心原理生成带 SMIL 动效（<animate> / <animateTransform>）的教学原理信息图 SVG：深色黑板质感背景，高亮荧光色矢量流程图、节点脉冲发光与箭头流向动画，结构一目了然",
          "svgGenWidth": 1080,
          "svgGenHeight": 1920,
          "svgGenBackground": "#0f172a"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "svgAnim",
        "typeId": "svg.anim",
        "title": "动态板书烘焙（GIF）",
        "params": {
          "svgFrames": 36,
          "svgDurationSec": 3,
          "svgWidth": 1080,
          "svgHeight": 1920,
          "svgBackground": "#0f172a"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "broll",
        "typeId": "asset.image",
        "title": "课程案例视觉插图（B-Roll）",
        "params": {
          "generateInstruction": "与课程案例配套的高清概念视觉插画，画面简洁有隐喻张力，色调与主讲人直播间协调，纯画面无文字",
          "generateAspectRatio": "9:16"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "bgm",
        "typeId": "asset.music",
        "title": "知识课堂轻音乐铺底",
        "params": {
          "generateInstruction": "舒缓知性的现代轻音乐伴奏，柔和木吉他与环境轻节拍，不抢人声频段，提升课程沉浸感",
          "generateMusicInstrumental": true
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "timeline",
        "typeId": "output.timeline",
        "title": "课程成片时间线"
      },
      {
        "key": "note",
        "typeId": "note.text",
        "title": "精品知识课全流程说明",
        "params": {
          "text": "专业知识课程口播全流程：\n1. 数字人口型同步：「主讲人定妆照」生成「主讲人出镜底片」后，与「讲师口播配音」一同接入「数字人口型同步」，产出声画严丝合缝的主讲视频；改讲稿只需重跑配音与口型同步。\n2. SVG 动态板书 + 案例 B-Roll：「核心知识点动态板书（SVG）」自动编写带 SMIL 动画的教学原理图，经「动态板书烘焙（GIF）」转为高清动图，连同「课程案例视觉插图」一起作为 B-Roll 切镜素材。\n3. 多轨自动合成：口型同步视频、动态板书 GIF、B-Roll 插图、口播配音与课堂轻音乐全部汇入「课程成片时间线」，一键合成带字幕与 BGM 闪避的精品知识短视频。"
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      {
        "from": "script",
        "to": "portrait",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-text"
      },
      {
        "from": "script",
        "to": "voice",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-text"
      },
      {
        "from": "script",
        "to": "talking",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-text"
      },
      {
        "from": "portrait",
        "to": "talking",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-image"
      },
      {
        "from": "talking",
        "to": "lipSync",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-video"
      },
      {
        "from": "voice",
        "to": "lipSync",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-voice"
      },
      {
        "from": "script",
        "to": "svgGen",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in"
      },
      {
        "from": "svgGen",
        "to": "svgAnim",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in"
      },
      {
        "from": "script",
        "to": "broll",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-text"
      },
      {
        "from": "script",
        "to": "bgm",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-text"
      },
      {
        "from": "lipSync",
        "to": "timeline",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in"
      },
      {
        "from": "svgAnim",
        "to": "timeline",
        "fromPort": "out-gif",
        "toPort": "in-image"
      },
      {
        "from": "broll",
        "to": "timeline",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-image"
      },
      {
        "from": "voice",
        "to": "timeline",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-voice"
      },
      {
        "from": "bgm",
        "to": "timeline",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-music"
      }
    ]
  }
}
